    "created_at": "2016-04-06T18:39:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-06T18:39:34Z",
    "body": "HTML's \"origin\" is actually probably not for anything at all; all the other terms _are_.  (They're for url, request, and http.)  HTML's origin is just... an origin.  Maybe for a document or a window or something?\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
