    "created_at": "2016-04-06T18:45:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-06T18:45:53Z",
    "body": "I wouldn't mark https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#origin \"for\" anything. That's just what an origin is. If there's a definition of \"the origin of a document\", then that would be `<dfn for=\"document\">origin</dfn>`.\n",
